#: scenario7:scenario7_CDE966D8_424B_449D_BDB0_A302D8A9E8BE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4b79338f753bfde0904694d467a760e6e75d61c21dc1c1d4078f69a5b0a6d2ac
#. default-sha256: a91c0fd68fc4f4e7898fc64035c009382590694767a21b317775003847cb20be
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_CDE966D8_424B_449D_BDB0_A302D8A9E8BE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I’m looking at neither the endless, eroding darkness, nor the visions of my past, ⟪k:1⟫but "
"the sea of blood spreading in all directions."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Davanti a me non ritrovo né la sconfinata oscurità, né le visioni del mio passato, ⟪k:1⟫"
"bensì il mare di sangue che si espande in ogni dove."

#: scenario7:scenario7_0B7E335C_F700_46DA_B344_D99D126704A6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6571e50bc118257bf7110e8c17ab4bb28753cd0f0afe303a9d82e4d74a8d9786
#. default-sha256: 58ad4bfc40e6c39a2bce4ac270e486a125293002ac11082d59f69053ecf20709
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_0B7E335C_F700_46DA_B344_D99D126704A6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I’m standing at the top of the observation tower, outside the door.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I’ve returned."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mi trovo in cima alla torre d’osservazione, fuori dalla porta.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Sono ritornato nel "
"mondo di Morgana—"

#: scenario7:scenario7_B13FC8E8_7690_47F3_BF80_04E6CEA3F9A9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b507f0200e9c73cc5888c1f83f79c08953b08a9f6decf6530b8476073ee2ce59
