msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2B1306B5_E4DA_499A_A661_6936ECC0D8BB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but it would seem my will is not as absolute as I had thought."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ma a quanto pare il mio volere non è assoluto come credevo."

#: scenario7:scenario7_693D17D2_4D59_444F_8262_01C1D36A1DE5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6c7a04199f90b7f4aa99fbdf4bd1414e4d9ad3db28b22cfd8ade50924eafea29
#. default-sha256: 3fafe7975ef61e82e70f632ac86778950d9a919f8c33bbb18145ce7c21543ee5
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_693D17D2_4D59_444F_8262_01C1D36A1DE5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What would you call that—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫the “power of love”?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Is ⟪k:5⟫that⟪k:6⟫ what "
"allowed this to happen?⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫How trite. ⟪k:9⟫Where’s the magic—⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫the ⟪k:12⟫"
"miracle⟪k:13⟫?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Come lo si potrebbe chiamare—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫il “potere dell’amore”?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫È⟪k:6⟫ ⟪k:7⟫"
"questo⟪k:8⟫ ad aver permesso che ciò accadesse?⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Com’è banale... ⟪k:11⟫Dov’è la magia—"
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫il ⟪k:14⟫miracolo⟪k:15⟫?"

