#: scenario7:scenario7_FA8BDA13_A7CB_4863_9F21_F72781AF6E5A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ff433928854d69055d699d27ee6e4300444f25c1a0ad2a7f18398d5c7db18db5
