msgstr "⟪k:0⟫di affrontarti,⟪k:1⟫ Morgana."

#: scenario7:scenario7_585B4755_3EAB_4364_880C_7D34AC3F31FB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cb7cbc07e582aa1706f6f6016c610d9cc6c4ab586e904ec8eecf8287b50f4bbc
