msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The air around the door has a distinct chill to it as I place my hand against the wood "
"surface."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Mentre poggio la mano sulla superficie di legno della porta,⟪k:2⟫mi accorgo che l’aria "
