#: scenario7:scenario7_188E107A_EF3F_47B9_9407_8F30878DA631
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 585693c323b39689c24b987c44f356e06f8fe6351258e588a806100167c9bc81
