msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Or should I be expecting another self-righteous lecture about how “hatred does you no "
"good”?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫O dovrei forse aspettarmi un’altra lezione moralista sul fatto che “l’odio non porta a "
"niente”?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_630BD0DE_F90E_44A7_9299_190B684C612D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c8f1e88847dd6de5322793e6b92a40a175a9c52456a1d59e12603a66177765cf
