msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_630BD0DE_F90E_44A7_9299_190B684C612D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Brilliant, Michel. Brilliant.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Do you have any idea how absurdly presumptuous "
"you’re being?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Trying to force your idea of redemption onto someone who has no interest "
"in it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Fantastico, Michel. Davvero fantastico.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Hai idea di quanto sia presuntuoso da "
"parte tua?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Tentare di imporre la tua idea di redenzione a qualcuno a cui non interessa "
"affatto."

#: scenario7:scenario7_01448503_32F6_4FF0_8033_3BB6C8C239FF
