msgid "⟪k:0⟫then I would have said you could revile those heartless men as much as you pleased."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫potresti oltraggiare quei tre uomini senza cuore quanto vuoi."

#: scenario7:scenario7_80AEDE1A_E079_4F43_BF1F_DC7B5D439794
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 98c614d0aa92ff2df93c637fac040f8a4be6e94437fb52abc2dd510cbd159f9c
