msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_80AEDE1A_E079_4F43_BF1F_DC7B5D439794"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But I refuse to believe that’s the whole story.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The men I saw beyond the first "
"three doors had genuine concerns and worries."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma mi rifiuto di credere che la storia sia tutta qui.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Gli uomini che ho visto oltre "
"quelle tre porte avevano preoccupazioni e timori sinceri."

#: scenario7:scenario7_FFCB0458_489F_4DF1_AEF5_B943A99AE731
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 55520d81de99e1f117f681d9a827a6ba6853207ac2fc92dc595345e0db569b8d
