msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FFCB0458_489F_4DF1_AEF5_B943A99AE731"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They felt things—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫real, human emotions—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫even if those things ultimately "
"led them down a path of destruction."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Provavano emozioni reali e umane, anche se quelle emozioni li hanno infine condotti sulla "
"via della distruzione."

#: scenario7:scenario7_CEC94C5E_2B7D_4088_BCB5_CE4948592495
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0e800087795ec2ba4fd0d3bcf099b34c123ad1b4d0c460ba1f0124e3f765a270
