"hundreds of years, bits of her memory came to reside within it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Lo stesso che Giselle usava per esercitarsi a sorridere...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Durante tutti "
